                ("Pattaya Mail — Pattaya to Koh Larn ferry times, prices 2026 (확인 2026.11.27)", "https://www.pattayamail.com/latestnews/news/how-to-get-from-pattaya-to-koh-larn-ferry-times-prices-and-beach-guide-for-2026-561423"),
